Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Prediction of m6A RNA Modification Sites
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Yuxin Guo [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yuxin Guo <yuxin.guo23@student.xjtlu.edu.cn>
Description: This package predicts m6A RNA modification probability and status 
    using a trained random forest model. It includes functions for both 
    single-site and multi-site prediction.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    stats
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/xinyu20050315-dot/m6APrediction
